hadiths[148]{hadithnumber,text}:
"1867","Abu Huraira told: When a man asked God’s messenger which sadaqa produced the greatest reward he replied: \That which you give when you are healthy and inclined to be mean"","" fearing poverty and hoping for a competence. Do not put it off and then say when you are about to die that you give such and such to so and so and such and such to so and so when it has already become the property of so and so.\""\n - Narrator: Abu Huraira.\n - Hadith: Give sadaqa while healthy and miserly"","" before death or wealth transfers ownership."""""
"1868","abwzr rzy allh anh khtay hyn kh myn nby akrm sly allh alyh wslm kay pas aaya jb aap kabh kay sayay myn bythay hwyay thay، aap sly allh alyh wslm nay mjhay dykha tw frmaya: rb kabh ky qsm، yh lwg sb say zyadh nqsan athanay walay hyn۔ myn nay pwchha، \wh kwn hyn، tm jn kay bdlay myn apnay bap awr man kw fdyh myn dwn ga؟\"" as nay jwab dya: \""jn kay pas sb say zyadh mal hay، swayay an kay jw khtay hyn kh 'yh awr yh awr yh lay lw'، an kay aagay، an kay pychhay، an kay dayyn awr bayyn، lykn wh thwray hyn۔ (bkhary w mslm)"""""
"1869","abwhryrh rzy allh anh say mrwy hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”skhy aadmy allh kay nzdyk، jnt kay qryb، aadmywn kay qryb awr jhnm say dwr hwta hay، lykn knjws aadmy allh say dwr، jnt say dwr، aadmywn say dwr awr jhnm kay qryb hwta hay، bay shk skhy aadmy allh kay nzdyk bkhl krnay walay abadt gzar say zyadh mhbwb hay۔ asay trmzy nay nql kya hay۔"
"1870","abw sayd khdry rzy allh anh say rwayt hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”mrd kay wqt sw dynay say bhtr hay kh aadmy apny zndgy myn ayk drhm sdqh kray۔ abwdaod nay asay nql kya hay۔"
"1871","hzrt abw drdaa rzy allh anh say mrwy hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”sdqh krnay wala ya ghlam kw mwt kay wqt aazad krnay wala aysa hay jysay as kay pas zrwrt say zyadh hwnay pr hdyh day“۔ asay ahmd، nsayy، darmy awr trmzy nay rwayt kya hay awr trmzy nay asay shyh kha hay۔"
"1872","abwsayd rzy allh anh nay rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm say rwayt kya kh frmaya: mwmn myn dw khsltyn jma nhyn hwtyn: knjwsy awr bra slwk۔ asay trmzy nay nql kya hay۔"
"1873","hzrt abwbkr sdyq rzy allh anh say rwayt hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”mkar، bkhyl awr lwgwn kw yad dlanay wala jnt myn nhyn jayay ga۔ asay trmzy nay nql kya hay۔"
"1874","abwhryrh rzy allh anh say mrwy hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”ansan ky sb say bry chyz bay chyny awr bay lgam bzdly hay۔ abd daod nay asay mntql kya۔"
"1875","aayshh rzy allh anha khty hyn kh jb rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm ky baz azwaj nay aap say pwchha kh an myn say kwn jld aap kay sath ml jayay ga tw aap sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya kh yh sb say lmba bazw hwga۔ chnanchh anhwn nay ayk dnda lay kr nap lya awr an myn swdh wh tha js ka bazw sb say lmba tha۔ anhyn bad myn malwm hwa kh sdqh ka mtlb bazw ky lmbayy hay، kywnkh zynb hy wh thy jw as kay sath jld ml jaty thy awr asay sdqh dynay ka shwq tha۔ bkhary nay asay nql kya tha۔ mslm kay wrzhn myn as nay khda kay rswl kw yh khtay hwyay rpwrt kya، \tm myn say jw sb say phlay myray sath shaml hw ga wh wh hay js ka bazw sb say lmba hay۔\"" as nay kha kh anhwn nay ayk dwsray kay bazw napay kh kwn sa lmba hay، awr sb say lmba bazw zynb tha kywnkh wh apnay hath say kam krty thy awr sdqh krty thy۔ * anhyn am almsakyn (zrwrt mndwn ky man) kha jata tha، yh lqb anhyn qbl az aslam myn dya gya tha۔"""""
"1876","abwhryrh rzy allh anh khtay hyn kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay ayk shkhs kay baray myn btaya kh js nay sdqh dynay ka aradh zahr kya awr jb wh asay nkal kr chwr kay hath myn day dya۔ sbh hwtay hy lwg batyn kr rhay thay awr khh rhay thay kh kl rat chwr kw sdqh dya gya۔ as shkhs nay kha: ’’aay allh tyry hmd hw، chwr kay lyay!‘‘ phr as nay sdqh dynay ka aradh zahr kya awr asay nkal kr ayk twayf kay hath myn day dya، sbh hwyy tw lwg batyn krrhay thay awr khh rhay thay kh ’’gzshth rat ayk twayf kw sdqh dya gya tha۔‘‘ as shkhs nay kha: ’’aay allh tyry hy hmd hw awr jb as nay sdqh dya tw as nay sdqh kya۔‘‘ as nay asay nkal kr ayk amyr kay hath myn rkh dya awr sbh hwtay hy lwg khh rhay thay kh kl rat ayk amyr kw sdqh dya gya tha، as shkhs nay kha: aay khda tyry hmd hw، ayk chwr، fahshh awr amyr! as kay bad as kay pas ayk wzhn tha js myn asay btaya gya tha kh chwr kw as ka sdqh as ky chwry say baz rhnay ka sbb bn skta hay، twayf shayd apny bay hyayy say baz aajayay، awr amyr aadmy shayd as pr twjh day awr khda ky dy hwyy chyzwn myn say khrch kray۔ (bkhary w mslm، alfaz bkhary kay hyn۔)"
"1877","anhwn nay kha kh nby sly allh alyh wslm nay ayk aadmy kay baray myn btaya kh ayk bay aab w gyah mydan myn ayk badl say aawaz aayy kh flan flan bagh۔ wh badl phr chlay gyay awr apnay pany kw laway kay rastay pr khaly kr dya، awr ayk chynl nay as pwray pany kw jma kr lya۔ wh pany kay pychhay gya awr apnay bagh myn khra ayk aadmy pr aaya jw apny kwdal say pany kw mwr rha tha۔ as nay as say as ka nam pwchha، awr jb as nay asay btaya tw yh why nam tha jw as nay badl say sna tha۔ as aadmy nay phr as say pwchha kh as nay apna nam kywn pwchha، tw as nay jwab dya kh as nay badlwn say ayk aawaz sny hay jhan say wh pany aaya tha، as nay apna nam astamal krtay hwyay kha، \flan ka bagh\""۔ phr as nay as say pwchha kh wh bagh myn kya kr rha hay tw as nay jwab dya kh jb say tm nay yh kha hay، myn as bat ka antzar kr rha hwn kh as say kya nklta hay، jb myn ayk thayy sdqh dwn ga، ayk thayy apnay awr apnay ahl w ayal kay khanay kay twr pr astamal krwn ga awr ayk thayy waps as myn rkhwn ga۔ mslm nay asay mntql kya۔"""""
"1878","anhwn nay kha kh myn nay nby sly allh alyh wslm kw yh frmatay hwyay sna hay kh bny asrayyl myn tyn aadmy thay، ayk kwrhy، ayk gnja awr ayk andha، jn ka allh taalyٰ amthan lyna chahta tha۔ chnanchh as nay an kay pas ayk frshth bhyja jw kwrhy kay pas aaya awr as say pwchha kh wh kya psnd kray ga tw as nay jwab dya kh achha rng، achhy jld awr as chyz say chhtkara hasl krna jw mjhay lwgwn kay lyay nagwar hay۔ as kay bad as nay asay mara awr as ky kraht dwr hwgyy awr asay achha rng awr achhy jld dy gyy۔ as nay phr pwchha kh wh kwn sy jayydad psnd kray ga tw as nay jwab dya kh asay awnt psnd hyn - ya shayd as nay kha kh mwyshy، kywnkh ashaq* ghyr yqyny tha، lykn ya tw kwrhy ya gnjay nay kha awnt awr dwsray nay kha۔ asay ayk awntny dy gyy jw ds mah kay bchay kay sath chly gyy thy، frshth nay as khwahsh ka azhar kya kh khda ky brkt as kay sath hw۔ as kay bad wh gnjay kay pas gya awr as say pwchha kh wh sb say zyadh kya psnd kray ga tw as nay jwab dya، \achhay bal، awr as say chhtkara hasl krna jw mjhay lwgwn kay lyay nagwar hay۔\"" phr as nay asay mara tw wh as say dwr hw gya awr asay achhay bal ata kyay gyay۔ phr as nay pwchha kh wh kwn sy jayydad sb say zyadh psnd kray ga tw as nay jwab dya kh asay mwyshy psnd hyn، as lyay asay ayk hamlh gayay dy gyy، frshth nay as khwahsh ka azhar kya kh khda ky rhmt as kay sath hw۔ as kay bad wh andhay kay pas gya awr as say pwchha kh wh kya psnd kray ga، tw as nay jwab dya kh khda myry bynayy mjhay lwtayay takh myn lwgwn kw dykh skwn۔ as kay bad as nay asay mara awr khda nay as ky bynayy bhal krdy۔ phr as nay pwchha kh wh kwn sy jayydad zyadh psnd kray ga tw as nay jwab dya kh wh bhyr bkryan psnd kray ga، as lyay asay ayk hamlh bhyr dy gyy۔ tyn aadmywn kay lyay bhyr bkryan pyda ky gyyn، ayk kay pas awntwn kay sath wady thy، dwsray kay pas mwyshy awr tysray kay pas bhyr bkry thy۔ phr frshth as shkhs kay pas aaya jw shkl w swrt myn kwrhy tha awr khnay lga kh myn ayk ghryb aadmy hwn js kay sfr myn wsayl khtm hw gyay hyn awr myry mnzl tk phnchnay ka wahd zryah allh awr phr aap pr mnhsr hay، as lyay myn tjh say as zat ka swal krta hwn js nay aap kw ayk awnt kay bdlay achha rng، achhy khal awr jayydad ata ky hay، js say myn nay bht say sfr tay kr lyay، lykn myn nay as sfr kw khtm kr dya۔ ada krna۔\"" as nay phr kha kh myn tmhyn phchanta hwn kya tm kwrhy nhyn thay jsay lwg ghn khatay thay awr ghryb aadmy thay jsay khda nay jayydad dy thy؟ as nay jwab dya، \""myn as jayydad ka wars bn gya hwn jysa kh azt myn ayk azym say bra aadmy hay۔\""  phr as nay kha: \""agr tm jhwt bwl rhay hw tw khda tmhyn tmhary sabqh halt pr lwtayay۔\"" wh gnjay ky shkl myn gnjay walay kay pas gya awr why kha jw as nay dwsray say kha tha awr wysa hy jwab mla tw as nay kha kh agr tm jhwt bwl rhay hw tw khda tmhyn tmhary sabqh halt pr lwtayay۔ as kay bad wh as shkhs kay pas gya jw shkl w swrt say nabyna tha awr khnay lga kh myn ayk mskyn awr msafr hwn js kay wsayl sfr myn khtm hwchkay hyn awr myry mnzl tk phnchnay ka wahd zryah khda awr phr tjh pr mnhsr hay as lyay myn tjh say as bhyr ka swal krta hwn js nay tyry bynayy bhal krdy js kay zryaay myn apnay sfr kw payh tkmyl tk phncha skwn۔ as nay jwab dya kh myn andha hw gya hwn awr allh taalyٰ nay myry bynayy bhal kr dy hay، lhza jw chahw lay lw awr jw chahw chhwr dw، myn khda ky qsm kha kr khta hwn kh aaj myn tm say jw kchh bhy lay ga as kay bdlay myn tmhyn nhyn dwn ga، jysa kh myn khda kay lyay dyta hwn۔ aap sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”apna mal mhfwz rkhw، kywnkh tm sb kw aazmaysh myn dal dya gya hay، awr allh tm say khwsh awr tmharay dwnwn sathywn say naraz hay۔ (bkhary wmslm)* ashaq by۔ abdallh، rwayt ky trsyl krnay walwn myn say ayk۔  as ka mtlb yh hay kh wh apnay khandan ka sb say bwrha، an ka lydr awr bhtryn zkhyrh tha۔ as ky wrast asy nwayt kay lwgwn say mly thy۔"""""
"1879","am bwzyd nay kha kh anhwn nay rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm say kha kh ayk ghryb aadmy as wqt tk as kay drwazay pr khra rhay ga jb tk kh wh shrmndh nh hw jayay، kywnkh as kay ghr myn as kay hath myn rkhnay kay lyay kchh nhyn tha، aap nay jwab dya: as kay hath myn kchh rkhw، agrchh wh jla hwa khr hw۔ ahmd، abwdaod awr trmzy nay asay rwayt kya hay، trmzy khtay hyn kh yh hsn shyh hay۔"
"1880","asman rzy allh anh kay ayk mokl nay kha kh am slmh rzy allh anha kw gwsht ka ayk tkra pysh kya gya awr rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm kw gwsht psnd hwnay ky wjh say anhwn nay khadmh say kha kh asay ghr myn rkh dw kywnkh shayd nby sly allh alyh wslm asay khayyn۔ as nay asay ghr ky khrky kay knaray pr rkh dya۔ drwazay pr ayk fqyr aaya awr khra hwa awr khnay lga، \sdqh day، allh aap kw brkt day\"" awr jb anhwn nay jwab dya، \""khda aap kw khwsh rkhay\""* tw wh fqyr chla gya۔ phr nby sly allh alyh wslm tshryf layay awr am slmh say pwchha kh kya aap kay pas khanay kay lyay kchh hay؟ as nay jwab dya kh as kay pas hay، awr nwkr say kha kh ja kr khda kay rswl kay pas wh gwsht lay aa، lykn jb wh gyy tw asay khrky kay knaray myn srf ayk chqmaq ka tkra mla۔ aap sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”wh gwsht chkmk myn bdl gya kywnkh tm nay asay mangnay walay kw nhyn dya۔ byhqy nay asay dlayl alnbw myn nql kya hay۔ * ayk pakyzh tbsrh as bat ky nshandhy krta hay kh kchh dynay ka aradh nhyn hay۔ aysay halat myn sb say aam jmlh hay allh krym (khda skhy hay)۔"""""
"1881","abn abas rzy allh anhma khtay hyn kh nby sly allh alyh wslm nay kchh lwgwn say pwchha kh kya wh chahtay hyn kh wh btayay kh kwn bdtryn mqam pr hay، jb anhwn nay jwab dya kh wh aysa kryn gay، tw aap sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”wh js say allh kay nam pr kchh manga jata hay awr as kay nam pr nhyn dyta۔ ahmd nay asay mntql kya۔"
"1882","abwzr rzy allh anh khtay hyn kh wh hath myn asa lay kr aayay awr asman rzy allh anh say dakhl hwnay ky ajazt chahy awr yh ajazt dy gyy۔ phr asman nay kab kw btaya kh abdalrhmn kchh jayydad chhwr kr fwt hw gyay hyn awr pwchha kh as kay baray myn tmhara kya khyal hay؟ jb as nay jwab dya kh agr as pr khda ka hq tha tw as myn kwyy hrj nhyn tw abwzr nay apny lathy atha kr kab kw mara awr kha kh myn nay rswl allh kw yh khtay sna hay kh agr myray pas as phar kay brabr swna hwta jsay myn khrch kr skta awr mjh say qbwl kr lyta tw myn apnay pychhay chh awqyh chhwrna psnd nhyn krta۔ as kay bad as nay asman kw tyn bar takyd ky kh agr as nay an ky bat nh sny hw tw as nay jwab dya kh myn nay sna hay۔ ahmd nay asay mntql kya۔"
"1883","aqbh by۔ hars khtay hyn kh ayk mwqa pr jb myn nay mdynh myn zhr ky nmaz rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm kay pychhay prhy thy، wh slam phyrnay kay bad jldy say athay awr lwgwn pr qdm rkhtay hwyay apny azwaj mthrat kay ayk kmray myn chlay gyay۔ lwg as ky jld bazy pr chwnk gyay awr jb wh bahr aaya awr as ky tyz rftar hrkt pr an ky hyrt kw dykha tw as nay kha kh mjhay kchh swna yad aaya jw hmaray pas tha awr myn as kay zyr asr nhyn rhna chahta tha as lyay myn nay hkm dya kh asay tqsym kr dya jayay۔ bkhary nay asay nql kya۔ as kay ayk nskhay myn anhwn nay kha kh myn nay sdqh ka kchh swna ghr myn chhwra tha awr rat tk rkhnay ky khwahsh nhyn thy۔"
"1884","aayshh rzy allh anha nay kha kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm ky bymary kay dwran an kay pas chh ya sat dynar thay jw aap sly allh alyh wslm nay anhyn tqsym krnay ka hkm dya tha، lykn wh aap ky tklyf myn msrwf rhyn۔ as nay as say pwchha kh chh ya sat dynar ka kya hwa، awr jb as nay jwab dya kh as nay an kay baray myn kchh nhyn kya kywnkh wh as kay msayb ky khdmt myn msrwf thy، tw as nay anhyn blaya، awr an kw apnay hath myn rkh kr kha، \khda ka nby kya swchay ga agr wh khda say mlyn jw an kay pas azym awr shan wala hay؟\"" ahmd nay asay mntql kya۔"""""
"1885","abwhryrh rzy allh anh khtay hyn kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm ayk mrtbh blal rzy allh anh kay pas gyay awr dykha kh an kay pas khjwrwn ka dhyr hay tw pwchha kh yh kya hay؟ ayk nay jwab dya kh yh myn nay kl kay lyay zkhyrh kr rkha hay، aap sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: \kya tm drtay nhyn kh kl qyamt kay dn tm as ky wjh say jhnm ky aag myn bhap bntay dykhw gay؟ asay khrch krw، blal، awr arsh kay malk ky trf say ghrbt say nh drw۔\"" byhqy nay asay shab alayman myn nql kya hay۔"""""
"1886","anhwn nay rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm ka yh frman nql kya hay kh aazady jnt myn ayk drkht hay js ky ayk shakh pkray ga awr shakh as kw as wqt tk nhyn chhwray gy jb tk kh wh asay jnt myn nh lay jayay awr bkhl jhnm myn ayk drkht hay js ky shakh pkrnay wala asay nhyn chhwray ga awr shakh asay as wqt tk nhyn chhwray gy jb tk kh wh asay nh lay aayay۔ byhqy nay asay shab alayman myn nql kya hay۔"
"1887","aly rzy allh anh nay rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm say rwayt ky hay kh aap nay frmaya: \sdqh kw bla takhyr dw، kywnkh yh msybt kay rastay myn khra hay۔\"" * khyal yh hay kh yh ayk rkawt kay twr pr kam krta hay js say aaft gzr nhyn skty۔"""""
"1888","abwhryrh rzy allh anh say rwayt hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”jw shkhs hlal ky kmayy myn say khjwr kay brabr sdqh kray، kywnkh allh taalyٰ srf hlal kw qbwl krta hay، allh asay apnay dayyn hath say qbwl kray ga، phr js nay asay dya as kay lyay as ky prwrsh krw jysa kh tm myn say kwyy apnay bchay kw palta hay، yhan tk kh wh phar ky trh hw jata hay۔ (bkhary w mslm)"
"1889","as nay khda kay rswl ka yh qwl nql kya hay kh \sdqh jayydad kw km nhyn krta، khda as ky azt brhata hay jw ksy kw maaf krta hay، awr kwyy bhy khda kay lyay apnay aap kw aajzy nhyn krta jb tk kh khda asay blnd nh kray۔\"" mslm nay asay mntql kya۔"""""
"1890","anhwn nay rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm ka arshad nql kya hay kh ”jw allh ky rah myn kchh bhy khrch kray ga asay jnt kay drwazay say dakhl hwnay ky dawt dy jayay gy، kywnkh jnt kay drwazay hyn، jw lwg nmaz prhtay hyn anhyn nmaz kay drwazay say dakhl hwnay ky dawt dy jayay gy، jw lwg jhad myn hsh lyn gay anhyn jhad kay drwazay say dakhl hwnay ky dawt dy jayay gy، awr jw sdqh day ga anhyn dakhl hwnay ky dawt dy jayay gy۔ rwzh darwn kw ryan kay drwazay say dakhl hwnay ky dawt dy jayay gy۔\* abwbkr rzy allh anh nay kha: \""js kw an drwazwn say dakhl hwnay ky dawt dy jayay asay kwyy tklyf nhyn hwgy، lykn kya an tmam drwazwn say ksy kw dakhl hwnay ky dawt dy jayay gy؟\"" as nay jwab dya، \""han، awr mjhay amyd hay kh tm ayk hw gay۔\"" (bkhary w mslm۔) * as lfz ka lghwy many hay 'khwb syrab' ya 'tazh'۔  as ky wzaht as trh ky gyy hay kh ’’an drwazwn myn say ksy ayk drwazay say‘‘ jysay ksy drwazay say dakhl hwnay wala jnt myn jayay ga۔"""""
"1891","anhwn nay kha kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay pwchha kh as dn ks nay rwzh rkha hay tw abwbkr rzy allh anh nay kha kh myn nay rwzh rkha hay۔ as nay pwchha kh as dn ks nay byyr ka pychha kya tha tw abwbkr nay kha kh as nay kya tha۔ as nay pwchha kh as dn ayk mskyn kw ks nay khana khlaya tha tw abwbkr rzy allh anh nay kha۔ as nay pwchha kh as dn ks nay ksy fasq ky ayadt ky thy tw abwbkr nay kha kh as nay kya tha۔ khda kay rswl nay phr frmaya kh js myn yh nykyan jma hwn gy wh zrwr jnt myn jayay ga۔ mslm nay asay mntql kya۔"
"1892","as nay khda kay rswl kw yh khtay hwyay rpwrt kya kh \tm myn say kwyy bhy mslman awrt apnay prwsy kw dynay kay lyay bhyr kay trtr kw bhy hqyr nh smjhay۔\"" (bkhary w mslm)"""""
"1893","jabr awr hzyfh nay rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm say rwayt ky hay kh \hr ahsan ka aml sdqh hay۔\"" (bkhary w mslm)"""""
"1894","abwzr rzy allh anh say rwayt hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”ksy bhy ahsan kw hqyr nh smjhw، yhan tk kh apnay bhayy say khwsh mzajy kay sath mlna“۔ mslm nay asay mntql kya۔"
"1895","abw mwsyٰ ashary rzy allh anh say rwayt hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya kh hr mslman kw sdqh dyna chahyay۔ as say pwchha gya kh yh as pr kysay lagw hw skta hay js kay pas kchh nh hw tw jwab dya kh apnay hath say kam kray، as say apnay lyay faydh athayay awr sdqh kray۔ as say pwchha gya kh agr wh yh kam nh kr skay ya nh kray tw kya hw ga، tw jwab dya kh zrwrt mnd awr ghm zdh ky mdd krw۔ as say pwchha gya kh agr aysa nh kya tw kya kray tw jwab dya kh nyky ka hkm dw۔ as say pwchha gya kh agr wh aysa nh kray tw kya kray، tw jwab dya kh brayy say baz rhw، kywnkh yh as kay lyay sdqh hay۔ (bkhary w mslm)"
"1896","abwhryrh rzy allh anh say mrwy hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”aadmy ky anglywn awr anglywn ky hr hdy hr rwz swrj tlwa hwnay kay bad sdqh krty hay، agr kwyy dw aadmywn kay drmyan ansaf kray tw yh sdqh hay، agr kwyy ksy aadmy ky mdd apnay janwr say kray، as pr apna saman lday ya athayay، tw yh sdqh hay، hr ayk ky trf achha lfz awr qdm athana sdqh hay۔ rastay say nqsan phnchana sdqh hay۔\ (bkhary w mslm۔) * mrqat tjwyz krta hay kh transmytr 'lwdng ya lftng' khta hay، as myn shk hay kh kwn sa lfz astamal hwa hay۔"""""
"1897","sydh aayshh rzy allh anha say rwayt hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”bny aadm myn say hr ayk kw tyn sw sath jwrwn say pyda kya gya hay، ps jw allh ky brayy byan krta hay، allh ky hmd krta hay، allh ky tsbyh krta hay، allh say astghfar krta hay، pthr، kanta ya hdy htata hay، jw kchh ansanwn kay lyay jwrta hay، wh as kay lyay jw kchh hay wh dwbarh pyda krta hay۔ an tyn sw sath ky tadad pr aatraz krnay wala as dn khwd kw jhnm say nkal kr chlay ga۔ mslm nay asay mntql kya۔"
"1898","aba zr nay khda kay rswl ka byan krtay hwyay kha: \khda ky shan kay hr byan myn، as ky azmt kay hr byan myn، as ky hmd kay hr byan myn، hr as aalan myn kh wh wahd khda hay، mazz chyzwn ka hkm dynay myn، qabl aatraz chyzwn say mna krnay myn، awr mrd kay mbashrt myn sdqh hay۔ yh pwchhay janay pr kh kya ksy kay shwq kw pwra krnay pr ajr mlay ga tw as nay kha kh btao agr wh asay hram chyz kay lyay wqf kr day tw kya as pr gnah nhyn hwgaasy trh agr wh asay ksy hlal kay lyay wqf kr day tw asay bhy ajr mlay ga۔ mslm nay asay mntql kya۔"""""
"1899","hzrt abwhryrh rzy allh anh say mrwy hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”ayk dwdh waly awntny js pr bht zyadh dwdh dya jayay awr wh bkry js myn bht zyadh dwdh dya jayay، jw sbh kay wqt dwdh ka ayk brtn awr sham kw dwsra brtn bnayay، achha sdqh hay۔ (bkhary w mslm)"
"1900","ans rzy allh anh say mrwy hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”agr kwyy mslman kwyy aysy chyz lgayay ya bwyay js say ansan، prndh ya hywan khata hay tw yh as kay lyay sdqh shmar hwta hay۔ (bkhary w mslm)"
"1901","jabr say mslm ky rwayt myn hay kh jw chyz as say chwry hwyy hay wh as kay lyay sdqh hay۔"
"1902","abwhryrh rzy allh anh say rwayt hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”ayk bdkar awrt kw bkhsh dya gya jw knwyn kay mnh pr hanptay hwyay awr pyas say mrnay walay ktay pr aayy، as nay apna jwta atar kr apnay sr pr bandha awr as kay lyay pany nkala، as wjh say asay maaf kr dya gya۔ as say pwchha gya kh kya lwgwn kw janwrwn kay sath jw kchh kya gya as ka ajr mlta hay، tw jwab dya، \hr jandar kay slslay myn ayk ajr dya jata hay۔\""* (bkhary w mslm) * lfzy twr pr hr chyz ka jgr nm hwta hay۔"""""
"1903","abn amr awr abwhryrh rzy allh anhma say mrwy hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”ayk awrt kw bly ky wjh say sza dy gyy jsay as nay bnd rkha yhan tk kh wh bhwk say mr gyy، as nay asay nh khana khlaya awr nh hy bahr janay dya takh wh zmyn pr ryngnay waly chyzwn kw kha lay۔ (bkhary w mslm)"
"1904","abwhryrh rzy allh anh say rwayt hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”ayk aadmy jw drkht ky ayk thny pr aaya jw srk pr chrha hwa tha awr as nay fyslh kya kh mslmanwn kay rastay say ht kr asay jnt myn laya jayay ga۔ (bkhary w mslm)"
"1905","as nay khda kay rswl kw yh khtay hwyay byan kya kh \myn nay ayk aadmy kw jnt myn ghwmtay hwyay dykha hay kh wh ayk drkht kw kat rha tha jw srk pr khra tha awr lwgwn kw pryshan kr rha tha۔\"" mslm nay asay mntql kya۔"""""
"1906","abwbrzh rzy allh anh khtay hyn kh jb myn nay rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm say kha kh wh mjhay kwyy aysy chyz skhayyn js say wh faydh athayyn، tw aap sly allh alyh wslm nay an chyzwn kw htanay ka hkm dya jw mslmanwn kw an kay rastay say tng krty hyn۔ mslm nay asay mntql kya۔"
"1907","abdallh by۔ slam nay kha: jb nby sly allh alyh wslm mdynh tshryf layay awr myn nay ja kr aap ka chhrh dykha tw myn nay phchan lya kh yh jhwtay ka chhrh nhyn hay۔ aap nay phly bat yh khy kh ’’agr tm lwg hr as shkhs kw slam krw js say tm mltay hw، khana khlatay hw، apnay rshth darwn ky bhlayy ka khyal rkhtay hw awr rat kw jb lwg sw rhay hwn tw nmaz prhw tw tm jnt myn slamty kay sath dakhl hw jao gay۔‘‘ asay trmzy، abn majh awr darmy nay rwayt kya hay۔"
"1908","abdallh by۔ amrw rzy allh anh say rwayt hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”agr tm rhmn ky abadt krw gay، khana khlao gay awr js say bhy mlw gay an kw slam krw gay tw tm jnt myn slamty kay sath dakhl hw jao gay۔ asay trmzy awr abn majh nay rwayt kya hay۔"
"1909","ans rzy allh anh say rwayt hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”sdqh rb kay ghzb kw thnda krta hay awr bry mwt kw rwkta hay۔ asay trmzy nay nql kya hay۔"
"1910","jabr rzy allh anh say rwayt hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”hr ahsan ka aml sdqh hay، awr ahsan myn apnay bhayy say khwsh mzajy kay sath mlna awr apnay dwl say apnay bhayy kay brtn myn pany dalna shaml hay۔ asay ahmd awr trmzy nay rwayt kya hay۔"
"1911","abwzr rzy allh anh say rwayt hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”jb tm apnay bhayy kay chhray pr mskraht lgwao، ya achhy bat ka hkm dw، ya qabl aatraz batwn say mna krw، ya gmrah shkhs ky rahnmayy krw، ya ksy bry nzr walay ky mdd krw، ya rastay say pthr، kantay awr hdyan htao، ya apny dwl say pany dalw tw asay apnay bhayy ka sdqh shmar krw۔ trmzy nay asay rwayt kya hay awr kha hay kh yh ghryb rwayt hay۔"
"1912","sad b۔ abadh nay rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm kw btaya kh am sad fwt hw gyy hyn awr an say pwchha kh sdqh ky kwn sy swrt bhtr hay؟ jb as nay jwab dya kh pany bhtryn hay tw as nay ayk knwan khwda awr kha kh yh am sad kay lyay hay۔ asay abwdaod awr nsayy nay rwayt kya hay۔"
"1913","abwsayd rzy allh anh say rwayt hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”jw mslman ksy mslman kw brhnh hw kr lbas phnayay ga tw allh taalyٰ asay jnt kay sbz kpray phnayay ga، jw mslman bhwkay mslman kw khana khlayay ga tw allh taalyٰ asay jnt kay phlwn myn say kchh khlayay ga، awr jw mslman ksy mslman kw pyasa hw kr playay ga tw allh taalyٰ asay smndr myn say kchh playay ga“۔ asay abwdaod awr trmzy nay rwayt kya hay۔ qraan 83:25۔"
"1914","fatmh bnt qys rzy allh anh nay rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm say rwayt ky kh \zkw kay alawh bhy kchh wajb alada hay\""* phr aap nay tlawt frmayy: \""yh tqwyٰ nhyn hay kh tm apnay mnh mshrq awr mghrb ky trf phyr lw۔ * kha jata hay kh as myn bhkary kay lyay skhawt، mangnay walay kw rqm ya saman dynay ky tyary، awr aam mhman nwazy shaml hyn۔  qraan 2:177۔"""""
"1915","bwhysh nay apnay wald kay hwalay say kha kh as nay khda kay rswl say pwchha kh wh kwn sy chyz hay js say ankar krna hram hay awr btaya gya kh wh pany hay۔ as nay allh kay nby say swal dhraya awr btaya gya kh yh nmk hay۔ jb as nay tysry bar khda kay nby say pwchha tw jwab mla kh ’’nyky krna tmharay hq myn bhtr hay۔‘‘ abwdaod nay asay nql kya hay۔"
"1916","jabr rzy allh anh say mrwy hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”jw kwyy bnjr zmyn kasht kray ga asay as ka ajr mlay ga، awr jw janwr as myn say khayay ga wh as kay lyay sdqh shmar hw ga۔ nsayy awr darmy nay asay nql kya hay۔ *as myn ansan، hywan awr prnday shaml hyn۔ lfz aafyh hay۔"
"1917","albraa nay rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm say rwayt ky hay kh \jw shkhs dwdh dynay kay lyay janwr ya chandy kay skay qrz dyta hay، ya ksy kw rasth dkhata hay، tw yh as kay ghlam kw aazad krnay kay brabr hwga۔\"" asay trmzy nay nql kya hay۔"""""
"1918","abw jry jabr bn slym nay kha: myn mdynh aaya awr ayk aadmy kw dykha js ky rayay pr lwg aml krtay thay، kywnkh as nay an kay as pr aml kyay bghyr kchh nhyn kha۔ myn nay pwchha kh wh kwn hay، awr jb mjhay btaya gya kh wh khda kay rswl hyn، tw myn nay dw bar kha، \aap pr slamty hw، khda kay rswl۔\"" aap nay frmaya: yh mt khw kh tm pr slamty hw، kywnkh yh mrnay walwn kw slam hay، blkh yh khw kh tm pr slamty hw۔ myn nay as say pwchha kh kya wh khda ka rswl hay، tw as nay jwab dya kh myn khda ka rswl hwn kh agr tmhyn kwyy tklyf phnchay awr tm asay pkarw tw asay dwr krday ga، agr tm pr qht ka sal aayay awr tm asay pkarw tw chyzyn brh jayyn gy، agr tm ksy bnjr zmyn ya byaban myn apna swary khw bythw awr asay pkarw tw asay bhal kr dwn ga۔ myn nay as say kha kh wh mjhay hkm day tw as nay kha kh ksy kw galy nh dw۔ as kay bad myn nay kbhy ksy aazad ya ghlam، awnt ya bhyr kw galy nhyn dy۔ aap sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”awr ahsan kay ksy aml kw mamwly nh smjhw، kywnkh jb tm apnay bhayy say bat krtay hw tw as ky trf dykhna ahsan hay۔ apna nchla lbas aadha ghtnay tk phnyn، lykn agr aap asay napsnd krtay hyn، tw asay tkhnwn tk janay dyn۔ tahm، aap kw asay pychhay nhyn chhwrna chahyay، kywnkh yh ayk qsm ka ghrwr hay، awr khda ghrwr kw psnd nhyn krta۔ agr kwyy aap kw ksy aysy bat pr mlamt ya mlamt kray jw wh aap kay baray myn janta hay tw as kay baray myn js chyz kay baray myn aap jantay hyn as pr asay mlamt nh kryn kywnkh as ky shrart as kay drwazay pr pray gy۔ abwdaod nay asay rwayt kya hay awr trmzy nay slam ka hsh nql kya hay۔ ayk nskhh myn hay kh ’’as ka bdlh aap kw mlay ga awr as ka fsad as ka hwga۔‘‘"""""
"1919","aayshh rzy allh anha khty hyn kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay pwchha kh ayk bkry jw anhwn nay mary hay as myn say ktny baqy rh gyy hay، jb anhwn nay aap kw btaya kh srf as ka kndha baqy hay tw aap sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: \as kay kndhay kay alawh baqy sara hsh baqy hay۔\"" * as ka mtlb yh hay kh jw kchh dwsrwn kw dyta hay as ky dyrpa qymt hwty hay، kywnkh yh dyna bnyady twr pr khda ky khatr hwta hay۔ jbkh jw kchh rkhta hay wh khwd ghrzy ky nshandhy krta hay awr as ky srf aarzy qdr hwty hay۔"""""
"1920","abn abas rzy allh anhma khtay hyn kh myn nay rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm kw frmatay hwyay sna: ”jw mslman ksy mslman kw phnnay kay lyay lbas day ga wh as wqt tk allh ky hfazt myn rhay ga jb tk as ka ayk tkra as pr baqy rhay ga۔ asay ahmd awr trmzy nay rwayt kya hay۔"
"1921","abdallh by۔ msawd rzy allh anh nay nby sly allh alyh wslm say yh bat mnswb ky kh tyn aysay hyn jn kw allh psnd krta hay: ayk wh shkhs jw rat kw ath kr ktab alhy ky tlawt krta hay، dwsra wh shkhs jw apnay dahnay hath say sdqh krta hay awr asay chhpata hay (abdallh nay swcha kh as nay apnay bayyn hath say jwra)؛ awr wh shkhs jw ksy mhm pr hw awr jb as kay sathy rastay myn hwn tw dshmn ka samna hw۔ trmzy nay asay nql kya hay، lykn kha hay kh yh ayk rwayt hay js ka lhaz nhyn kya jata hay، as kay nql krnay walwn myn say ayk، abwbkr bn. 'ayash، bht sy ghltywn ka mjrm۔"
"1922","abwzr rzy allh anh say rwayt hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”tyn aysay hyn jn say allh mhbt krta hay awr tyn jn say allh nfrt krta hay، wh hyn jn say allh mhbt krta hay: ayk wh shkhs jw jb aaya awr ksy say allh kay nam pr bhyk mangta tha، nh kh as kay awr an kay drmyan ksy talq ky wjh say، awr an ky trf say ankar kr dya gya، tw an say dstbrdar hw gya awr asay chhp kr kchh dya، js nay rat kay sfr kay baray myn sb kchh malwm kya awr as shkhs kw allh kay swa ksy nay thfh nhyn dya۔ jb tk kh lwg as kay mqablay myn an kay lyay swna zyadh psnd krtay thay، awr jb wh sr jhkayay as ky abadt myn mshghwl hw jatay thay awr qraan ky aayat ky tlawt krtay thay؛ awr ayk aadmy jw ayk dstay myn tha jw dshmn say mla tha awr asay shkst dy gyy thy، phr bhy asay mar dya gya ya fth dy gyy، wh tynwn jn say allh taalyٰ ayk ghryb aadmy say nfrt krta hay۔ jabranh hay۔\ asay trmzy awr nsayy nay nql kya hay lykn nsayy nay an tynwn ka zkr nhyn kya jn say khda kw nfrt hay۔"""""
"1923","ans rzy allh anh say mrwy hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”jb allh taalyٰ nay zmyn kw pyda kya tw as nay hlna shrwa kr dya، tw as nay pharwn kw pyda kya، an kw as pr hkm dya، awr wh sakn hw gyy۔ frshtay pharwn ky taqt dykh kr hyran hwyay awr apnay rb say pwchha kh kya as ky mkhlwq myn pharwn say zyadh mzbwt kwyy chyz hay، js pr as nay jwab dya kh lwha zyadh mzbwt hay۔ anhwn nay pwchha kh kya as ky tkhlyq myn kwyy chyz lwhay say zyadh mzbwt hay، tw as nay jwab dya kh aag hay۔ anhwn nay pwchha kh kya as ky tkhlyq myn kwyy chyz aag say zyadh taqtwr hay tw as nay jwab dya kh pany hay۔ anhwn nay pwchha kh kya as ky mkhlwq myn kwyy chyz pany say zyadh taqtwr hay tw as nay jwab dya kh hwa hay۔ anhwn nay pwchha kh kya as ky mkhlwq myn kwyy chyz hwa say zyadh taqtwr hay tw as nay jwab dya kh han abn aadm jw apnay dahnay hath say sdqh krta hay awr asay bayyn hath say chhpata hay۔ trmzy nay asay rwayt kya hay awr kha hay kh yh ghryb rwayt hay۔"
"1924","abwzr rzy allh anh say rwayt hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”kwyy mslman as kay pas mwjwd hr qsm ky jayydad myn say ayk jwra allh ky rah myn wqf krnay kay lyay nhyn day ga، jb tk kh jnt kay tmam mhafz as say mlaqat nh kryn awr as kay pas jw kchh hay asay hasl krnay kay lyay blayyn۔ abwzr rzy allh anh nay pwchha kh as ky nwayt kya hw gy tw aap nay jwab dya kh agr awnt hwn tw dw hwn gay awr agr gayay hwn tw dw hwn gay۔ nsayy nay asay nql kya hay۔"
"1925","mrthd by۔ abdallh nay kha kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm kay sathywn myn say ayk nay anhyn btaya kh myn nay anhyn yh khtay hwyay sna hay kh qyamt kay dn mwmn ka sayh as ka sdqh hw ga۔ ahmd nay asay mntql kya۔"
"1926","abn msawd rzy allh anh say mrwy hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”jw shkhs aashwrh kay dn apnay ahl w ayal kw frakhdly say kchh day ga، allh taalyٰ as kay lyay baqy sal aazad rhay ga۔ sfyan nay kha kh as nay as ka tjrbh kya awr asay aysa hy paya۔ razn nay asay mntql kya۔"
"1927","byhqy nay shab alayman myn asay [abn msawd]، abwhryrh، abw sayd awr jbyr say rwayt kya hay، lykn asay zayf qrar dya hay۔"
"1928","abw amamh nay abwzr kay baray myn btaya kh anhwn nay rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm say pwchha kh sdqh ka ajr kya hay، awr jwab mwswl hwa، \kyy gna zyadh، awr khda kay pas as say bhy zyadh۔\"" ahmd nay asay mntql kya۔"""""
"1929","abwhryrh awr hkym by۔ hzam nay rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm ka yh frman nql kya hay: \bhtryn sdqh wh hay jw qablyt kw chhwr day، awr an say shrwa krw jn kay lyay tm zmh dar hw۔\"" bkhary nay asay nql kya hay lykn mslm nay asay akylay hkym say nql kya hay۔"""""
"1930","abwmsawd rzy allh anh say rwayt hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”jb kwyy apnay ahl w ayal pr allh taalyٰ say swab ky nyt say khrch krta hay tw yh as kay lyay sdqh shmar hwta hay۔ (bkhary w mslm)"
"1931","abwhryrh rzy allh anh say mrwy hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”ayk dynar myn say jw tm rah khda myn khrch krtay hw، ya ghlam aazad krtay hw، ya ksy mskyn kw sdqh krtay hw، ya apnay ahl w ayal ky kfalt myn khrch krtay hw، wh sb say bra ajr hay۔ mslm nay asay mntql kya۔"
"1932","hzrt swban rzy allh anh say mrwy hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”sb say afzl dynar wh hay jw aadmy apnay ahl w ayal pr khrch krta hay، ayk dynar wh hay jsay wh rah khda myn apnay janwrwn pr khrch krta hay، awr ayk dynar jw rah khda myn apnay sathywn pr khrch krta hay“۔ mslm nay asay mntql kya۔"
"1933","am slmh rzy allh anha khty hyn kh anhwn nay rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm say pwchha kh kya abw slmh rzy allh anh kay bytwn pr khrch kya hay، kywnkh wh srf an kay bytay hyn، tw aap sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”an pr khrch krw، tm an pr jw kchh khrch krtay hw as ka ajr tmhyn mlay ga“۔ (bkhary w mslm)"
"1934","abdallh bn ky bywy zynb۔ msawd rzy allh anh khtay hyn kh jb rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay awrtwn say kha kh sdqh dyn، agrchh yh an kay zywrat myn say kchh hy kywn nh hwn، tw wh abdallh kay pas waps aayyn awr kha: tm aysay aadmy hw js kay pas zyadh mal nhyn hay، awr allh kay rswl nay hmyn sdqh dynay ka hkm dya hay، as lyay jao awr as say mangw، agr myn tmhyn day ga tw myn kwyy awr kam krwn ga۔ as nay as say kha kh khwd jana bhtr hay، chnanchh as nay ja kr rswl allh kay drwazay pr ansar ky ayk awrt kw paya jw asy mqsd kay lyay aayy thy js kay lyay wh aayy thy۔ ab khda kay rswl kw azt w tkrym say nwaza gya awr jb blal an kay pas aayay tw anhwn nay as say kha kh khda kay rswl kay pas jao awr asay btao kh drwazay pr dw awrtyn hyn jw as say pwchhnay aayy hyn kh kya an kay shwhrwn awr ytymwn kw jw an kay zmh dar hyn an kw sdqh dyna an kay kam aayay ga، lykn asay yh mt btana kh hm kwn hyn؟ blal andr gyay awr an say pwchha، rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay an say pwchha kh yh awrtyn kwn hyn؟ jb as nay asay btaya kh yh ansar awr zynb ky awrtyn hyn tw as nay as say pwchha kh yh kwn sy zynb hay awr jb asay btaya gya kh yh abdallh ky bywy hay tw as nay kha۔ ’’an kay lyay dw ajr hwn gay، qrabt ka swab awr sdqh ka swab۔‘‘ (bkhary w mslm، lfz mslm ka hay۔)"
"1935","mymwnh bnt hars nay byan kya kh anhwn nay rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm kay zmanay myn ayk lrky kw aazad kya awr jb aap sly allh alyh wslm say as ka tzkrh kya tw aap sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”agr tm asay apnay mamwn kw day dytay tw as say tmhara ajr brh jata۔ (bkhary w mslm)"
"1936","aayshh rzy allh anha nay kha kh jb anhwn nay rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm kw btaya kh an kay dw prwsy hyn awr pwchha kh an myn say ks kw thfh bhyjna hay tw aap sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”as kay lyay jw tmharay qryb rhta hay۔ bkhary nay asay nql kya۔"
"1937","abwzr rzy allh anh say rwayt hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”jb tm swp bnatay hw tw bht zyadh pany dalw awr apnay prwsywn ka khyal rkhw“۔ mslm nay asay mntql kya۔"
"1938","abwhryrh rzy allh anh nay rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm say pwchha kh kwn sa sdqh sb say afzl hay tw aap sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”jw bht km mal wala aadmy day skta hay، awr an say shrwa krw jn kay zmh tm hw۔ abwdaod nay asay nql kya hay۔"
"1939","slyman by amyr nay khda kay rswl ka byan krtay hwyay kha: \ksy ghryb kw dya janay wala sdqh srf sdqh hay، lykn jb ksy rshth dar kw dya jayay tw as ka dwhra mqsd hwta hay، sdqh awr ayk mrbwt rbt dwnwn۔\"" ahmd، trmzy، nsayy، abn majh awr darmy nay asay rwayt kya hay۔"""""
"1940","abwhryrh rzy allh anh khtay hyn kh ayk aadmy nby krym sly allh alyh wslm kay pas aaya kh as kay pas ayk dynar hay tw aap sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya kh asay apnay awpr khrch krw۔ as nay kha kh as kay pas ayk awr hay، awr as nay asay apnay bchwn pr khrch krnay kw kha۔ as nay kha kh as kay pas ayk awr hay، awr as nay asay apny bywy pr khrch krnay kw kha۔ as nay kha kh as kay pas ayk awr hay، awr as nay asay kha kh asay apnay nwkr pr khrch krw۔ as nay kha kh as kay pas ayk awr hay awr as nay jwab dya، \aap bhtr jantay hyn [as kay sath kya krna hay]۔\"" asay abwdaod awr nsayy nay rwayt kya hay۔"""""
"1941","abn abas rzy allh anhma say rwayt hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”myn tmhyn btaon ga kh aadmywn myn sb say bhtr kwn hay، wh ayk aadmy hay js nay apnay ghwray ky lgam allh ky rah myn tham rkhy hay، myn tmhyn btaon ga kh as kay aagay kwn aata hay، wh wh shkhs hay jw chnd bkryan lay kr rkhst hw jata hay jw as kay pas hwty hyn awr an pr allh ka hq ada krta hay، myn tmhyn btaon ga kh wh aadmywn myn say kwn hay؟ khda ka nam hay lykn jw as kay nam pr kchh nhyn dyta۔‘‘ asay trmzy، nsl awr darmy nay nql kya hay۔"
"1942","am bzyd nay rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm say rwayt ky hay kh aap nay frmaya: \swal krnay walay kw [ksy chyz kay sath] bhyj dw، yhan tk kh srf jlay hwyay khr kay sath۔\"" asay malk awr nsayy nay nql kya hay awr trmzy awr abwdaod nay bhy asy asr kw nql kya hay۔"""""
"1943","abn amr rzy allh anhma say mrwy hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”jw allh kay nam say pnah mangay asay pnah dw، agr kwyy allh kay nam say mangay tw asay kchh day، agr kwyy tmhyn dawt day tw asay qbwl krw، awr agr kwyy tm say hsn slwk kray tw as ka bdlh dw، lykn agr tm myn as ky taqt nh hw tw as kay lyay daa krw yhan tk kh tmhyn yh mhsws hw kh tm nay asay bdlh day dya hay۔ asay ahmd، abwdaod awr nsayy nay rwayt kya hay۔"
"1944","jabr rzy allh anh say rwayt hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”allh kay lyay jnt kay swa kchh nhyn mangna chahyay۔ abwdaod nay asay nql kya hay۔"
"1945","ans nay kha kh ansar myn say abw tlhh wh shkhs tha js kay pas khjwr kay sb say zyadh drkht thay، an ky sb say zyadh qymt bryrh thy jw msjd kay samnay thy awr aksr rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm as myn dakhl hwtay thay jw as myn mwjwd mytha pany pytay thay۔ jb yh aayt atry kh \tm as wqt tk nyky kw hasl nh krskw gay jb tk kh tm apny psnd ky chyz mft myn nh dw\""* abw tlhh athay awr rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm kay pas ja kr khnay lgay: \""khda kay rswl، khda frmata hay kh tm as wqt tk nyky kw hasl nhyn kr sktay jb tk kh tm apny psnd ky chyz aazadanh twr pr nh dw، awr myra mal js ky mjhay sb say zyadh qymt hay wh bryrh hay، as lyay myn nay as pr aml krnay kay lyay allh say sb say zyadh amyd rkhy۔ rastbazy awr as say mtalq khzanh؛  tw asay lagw krw، khda kay rswl، jw mqsd khda aap kw dkhata hay as pr lagw kryn۔\"" as nay jwab dya، \""braww! yh mnafa bkhsh jayydad hay۔ myn nay aap ky bat sny hay، awr myra khyal hay kh aap asay apnay qryby rshth darwn pr lagw kryn۔\"" abw tlhh nay khda kay rswl say kha kh wh aysa kryn gay، awr asay apnay qryby rshth darwn awr apnay wald ky trf say apnay chchazad bhayywn myn tqsym kr dya۔ (bkhary w mslm۔) *qraan 3:92  arby zban dkhrh hay، jw as nyk aml kw khda kay pas zkhyrh krnay ka tswr pysh krty hay jw aglay jhan myn as ka ajr day ga۔"""""
"1946","as nay khda kay rswl ka yh frman nql kya hay: \bhtryn sdqh aap kay bhwkay pyt kw syr krnay myn hay۔\"" * byhqy nay asay shab alayman myn nql kya hay۔ * lfzy twr pr \""jgr۔\"""""""
"1947","aayshh rzy allh anha say rwayt hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”jb kwyy awrt apnay ghr myn kchh khana dyty hay، asay zaya nhyn krty، tw as kay lyay as ka ajr hay jw as nay dya hay awr as kay shwhr kw as ky kmayy ka swab mlay ga، yhy bat dkandar pr bhy lagw hwty hay، ayk dwsray kay swab myn kwyy kmy nhyn krta۔ (bkhary w mslm)"
"1948","abwhryrh rzy allh anh say mrwy hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”jb kwyy awrt apnay shwhr ky kmayy hwyy chyz as kay hkm kay bghyr day tw as kay lyay as ka aadha ajr hay۔ (bkhary w mslm)"
"1949","abw mwsyٰ ashary rzy allh anh say mrwy hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”wh mwmn mslman zkhyrh andwz jw asay jw hkm dya gya hay asay pwry trh awr pwry khwsh aslwby kay sath dyta hay awr js kw dynay ka kha gya hay asay phnchata hay، wh an dw myn say ayk hay jw sdqh krtay hyn۔ (bkhary w mslm۔) *dwnwn as kay aaqa awr khwd hyn۔"
"1950","aayshh rzy allh anha khty hyn kh ayk aadmy nay rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm kw btaya kh an ky waldh ka achank antqal hw gya hay، anhwn nay kha kh agr wh bwl skty hwtyn tw wh sdqh krtyn۔ as lyay as nay pwchha kh kya as kay lyay kwyy ajr hay kh as nay as ky trf say sdqh dya، awr btaya gya kh wh kray gy۔ (bkhary w mslm)"
"1951","abw amamh khtay hyn kh anhwn nay hj alwdaa kay sal khtbh kay dwran rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm kw yh frmatay hwyay sna kh awrt kw chahyay kh wh apnay shwhr ky ajazt kay bghyr shwhr kay ghr say kwyy chyz nh day۔ as say pwchha gya kh kya wh khana bhy nhyn day sktyn awr jwab dya، \yh hmaray pas sb say bhtryn jayydad hay۔\"" asay trmzy nay nql kya hay۔"""""
"1952","sad rzy allh anh khtay hyn kh jb rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay awrtwn say byat ly tw ayk aalyٰ drjay ky awrt jw kh mdr ky awrtwn myn say malwm hwty thy athy awr khnay lgy: aay allh kay rswl، hm apnay waldyn، apnay bytwn awr apnay shwhrwn kay mhtaj hyn، lhza an kay mal kay ks hsay say hm jw chahyn kr sktay hyn؟ as nay jwab dya: \tazh khana jw tm khatay hw awr btwr thfh dytay hw۔\"" abwdaod nay asay nql kya hay۔ * arby kl hay، many: lfzy twr pr 'bwjh'"""""
"1953","abw lhm kay mokl amyr nay kha: myray srprst nay mjhay hkm dya kh myn kchh gwsht kat kr asay dhwp myn khshk kr dwn، phr jb ayk fqyr myray pas aaya tw myn nay asay kchh khanay kw dya۔ myray srprst kw as ka alm hwa awr as nay mjhay mara tw myn khda kay rswl kay pas gya awr as say maamlh byan kya۔ as nay asay blwaya awr pwchha tm nay asay kywn mara؟ as nay jwab dya: \wh myry hdayt kay bghyr myra khana day dyta hay۔\"" phr frmaya: tm myn swab bant dya gya hay۔ ayk rwayt myn as nay kha: myn ayk ghlam tha awr myn nay khda kay rswl say pwchha kh kya myn apnay srprst kay mal myn say kwyy sdqh day skta hwn؟ as nay jwab dya: han، awr swab tmharay drmyan brabr hw ga۔ mslm nay asay mntql kya۔"""""
"1954","amr by۔ alkhtab khtay hyn: myn nay ayk aadmy kw rah khda myn swary kay lyay ghwra dya، lykn js kay pas tha as nay as ky achhy trh dykh bhal nhyn ky، myn nay asay khrydna chaha awr swcha kh asay sstay damwn bych dwn ga۔ chnanchh myn nay rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm say pwchha، aap sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ” asay nh khrydw awr jw kchh tm nay sdqh dya hay asay waps nh lyna chahay wh tmhyn ayk drhm myn day، kywnkh jw sdqh dya hay asay waps lynay wala as ktay ky trh hay jw apny qay myn lwtta hay۔ ayk nskhh myn hay kh \sdqh kay twr pr jw kchh dya hay asay waps nh lw، kywnkh aysa krnay wala as shkhs ky trh hay jw as nay qay ky hay\""۔ (bkhary w mslm)"""""
"1955","brydh rzy allh anh khtay hyn kh jb wh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm kay pas bythay hwyay thay tw ayk awrt aap kay pas aayy awr khnay lgy: ya rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm myn nay ayk lwndy kw apny waldh ka sdqh dya jw ab fwt hw chky hay۔ as nay jwab dya۔ ’’tmhara ajr yqyny hay awr wrast nay tmhyn waps kr dya hay۔‘‘ as nay arz kya ya rswl allh as pr ayk mah ka rwzh wajb tha، kya myn as ky trf say rwzh rkhwn؟ as nay jwab dya: as ky trf say rwzh rkhw۔ as nay kha: as nay kbhy hj nhyn kya، tw kya myn as ky trf say hj krwn؟ aap nay frmaya: han، as ky trf say hj krw۔ mslm nay asay mntql kya۔"
"1956","Hazrat Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) bayan kartey hain, Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ne farmaya : ''jab Ramazan aata hai to aasman ke darwazey khol diye jatey hain.'' aur eik riwayat mein hai : '' jannat ke darwazey khol diye jatey hain aur jahannam ke darwazey band kar diye jatey hain aur shayatin ko jakad diya jata hai.'' aur eik riwayat mein hai : '' rehmat ke darwazey khol diye jatey hain.'' muttafaq aleh."
"1957","Hazrat Sehal bin Saad (Raziallahu anhu) bayan kartey hain Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ne farmaya : '' jannat ke aath darwazey hain, un mein se eik darwazey ka naam '' Rayyan'' hai, is mein se sirf roza daar hi dakhil hongey .'' muttafaq aleh."
"1958","Hazrat Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) bayan kartey hain, Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ne farmaya : ''jo shakhs eman w ikhlas aur sawab ki niyat se rozey rakhey to uskey sabiqa gunah maaf kar diye jatey hain, jo shakhs eman w ikhlas aur sawab ki niyat se Ramazan mein qiyam karey ( Namaz tarawih ka ehtimam karey ( to uskey sabiqa gunah maaf kar diye jatey hain, aur jo shakhs eman w ikhlas aur sawab ki niyat se shabe-qadr ka qiyam karey to uskey sabiqa gunah bakhsh diye jatey hain.'' muttafaq aleh."
"1959","Hazrat Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) bayan kartey hain, Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ne farmaya : '' ibne-Adam ke her nek amal ko das guna se saat so guna tak badha diya jata hai, Allah Taala farmata hai : rozey ke siwa , kyonkey wo merey liye hai aur main hi uski jaza dunga, wo apni khahish aur apney khaney ko meri wajeh se tarak karta hai. roza daar ke liye do khushiyan hain, eik farhat w khushi to uskey iftaar ke waqt hai jabkey eik khushi apney rab se mulaqat ke waqt hai, aur roza daar ke munh ki bo Allah ke yahan kastoori ki khushbu se bhi ziyada behtar hai, aur roza dhaal hai, jis roz tum mein se kisi ka roza ho to wo fohsh goi aur hiziyaan se ijtinab karey, agar koi usey bura bhala kahey ya us se ladaai jhagda karey to wo kahey ke main roza daar hun.'' muttafaq aleh."
"1960","Hazrat Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) bayan kartey hain, Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ne farmaya : ''jab Ramazan ki pehli raat hoti hai to shayatin aur sarkash jinnon ko jakad diya jata hai, jahannam ke tamam darwazey band kar diye jatey hain un mein se koi darwaza nahin khola jata, aur jannat ke tamam darwazey khol diye jatey hain aur un mein se koi darwaza band nahin kiya jata, aur manadi karney wala aelan karta hai : khair aur bhalai ke Talib ! aagey badh , aur shar ke Talib ! ruk ja , aur Allah ke liye jahannam se azad karda log hain, aur her raat aisey hota hai.''"
"1961","aur Imam Ahmed ne usey kisi sahabi se riwayat kya hai, aur Imam Tirmizi ne farmaya : ye hadees gharib hai. rawahu Ahmed ."
"1962","Hazrat Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) bayan kartey hain, Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ne farmaya : ''maahe-mubarak Ramazan tumharey paas aaya hai, Allah ne uska roza tum par farz kya hai, is mein aasman ke darwazey khol diye jatey hain, jahannam ke darwazey band kar diye jatey hain aur sarkash shayatin band kar diye jatey hain, us ( maah ( main eik raat hazar mahinon se behtar hai, jo shakhs uski khair w bhalai se mehroom kar diya gaya to wo ( her khair w bhalai sey) mehroom kar diya gaya .'' rawahu Ahmed w Nasai ."
"1963","Hazrat Abdullah bin Amr (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ne farmaya : '' roza aur Quran bandey ke liye sifarish karengey , roza arz kerega, rab ji ! maine din ke waqt khaney peeney aur khaahishat se usey rok rakha , uskey mutalliq meri sifarish qubul farma aur Quran arz kerega : maine usey raat ke waqt soney se rokey rakha , uskey mutalliq meri sifarish qubul farma , un dono ki sifarish qubul ki jaeygi .'' ( rawahu al-Behaqi fi-Shobil-Emaan ( ."
"1964","Hazrat Anas bin Malik (Raziallahu anhu) bayan kartey hain, Ramazan aaya to Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ne farmaya : ''ye mahina jo tumharey paas aaya hai us main eik raat hai jo ke hazar mahinon se behtar hai, aur jo shakhs us se mehroom kar diya gaya to wo her qism ki khair w bhalai se mehroom kar diya gaya aur uski khair se mehroom shakhs her qism ki khair w bhalai se mehroom hai.''"
"1965","Hazrat Salman Farsi (Raziallahu anhu) bayan kartey hain, Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ne Shoban ke aakhiri roz hamen khitab kartey huey farmaya : '' logo ! eik ba barkat maahe-azeem tum par saya-figan hua hai, us main eik raat hazar mahinon se behtar hai, Allah ne uska roza farz aur raat ka qiyam nafl qarar diya hai, jisney is mein koi nafl kaam kya to wo uskey ilawa baqi mahinon mein farz ada karney waley ki tarah hai aur jisney is mein farz ada kya to wo us shakhs ki tarah hai jisney uskey ilawa mahinon mein sattar farz ada kiye, wo maahe-sabr hai jabke sabr ka sawab jannat hai, wo gham gusari ka mahina hai, is mein momin ka rizq badha diya jata hai, jo is mein kisi roze daar ko iftaarii kiraaey to wo uskey gunahon ki maghfirat ka aur jahannam se azadi ka sabab hogi aur usey bhi us (roze daar) ki misl sawab milta hai aur uskey ajr mein koi kami nahin ki jati.'' ham ne arz kya, Allah ke Rasool ! ham sab ye istataat nahin rakhtey ke ham roze daar ko iftaari karaein, to Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ne farmaya : ''Allah ye sawab us shakhs ko bhi ata farma deta hai jo lassi ke ghoont ya eik khajoor ya pani ke eik ghoont se kisi roze daar ki iftaari karata hai aur jo shakhs kisi roze daar ko pet bharkar deta hai to Allah usey merey hoz se (pani) pilaeyga to usey jannat mein dakhil ho janey tak piyas nahin lagegi aur wo aisa mahina hai jis ka awwal (ashra) rehmat , uska wast maghfirat aur uska aakhir jahannam se khulaasi hai, aur jo shakhs is mein apney mamlook se riayat bartega to Allah uski maghfirat farma dega aur usey jahannam se azad kar dega.''"
"1966","Hazrat ibne-Abbas (Raziallahu anhu) bayan kartey hain, jab maah Ramazan aata to Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) her qaidi ko azad farma detey aur her saail ko ata kya kartey they."
"1967","Hazrat ibne-Umar (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ne farmaya : '' jannat ko Ramazan ke liye pura saal muzayyan kya jata hai.'' farmaya : ''jab Ramazan ka pehla din hota hai to arsh ke nichey jannat ke patton se hawa chalti hui hoore-ain tak pahunchti hai to wo kehti hain : rab ji ! apney bandon mein se hamarey shohar bana dey, ham un se apni aankhen thandi karen aur wo ham se apni aankhen thandi keren.'' Imam Behaqi ne teeno ahadis Shobil-emaan mein riwayat ki hain."
"1968","Hazrat Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) se riwayat kartey hain ke aap (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ne farmaya : '' Ramazan ki aakhiri raat unki (yani meri) ummat ko bakhsh diya jata hai.''arz kya gaya, Allah ke Rasool ! kya wo shabe-qadr hai? farmaya : '' nahin, lekin jab kaam karney wala apna kaam mukammal kar leta hai to usey pura pura ajr diya jata hai.''"
"1969","Hazrat ibne-Umar (Raziallahu anhu) bayan kartey hain, Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ne farmaya : ''tum roza na rakho yahan tak ke tum ( Ramazan ka ( chaand dekh lo aur roza rakhna moquf na karo yahan tak ke tum us ( Hilal shawwal ( ko dekh lo , agar matla abr aalud ho to uskey liye ( tees din ka ( andaza kar lo .'' aur eik riwayat mein hai, farmaya : ''maah untees din ka bhi hota hai, tum roza na rakho yahan tak ke tum us ( Hilal Ramazan ( ko dekh lo , agar matla abr aalud ho to phir tees ki ginti mukammal kar lo.'' muttafaq aleh."
"1970","Hazrat Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) bayan kartey hain, Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ne farmaya : '' us (Hilal Ramazan) ke dekhney par roza rakho aur us (Hilal shawwaal) ke dekhney par roza rakhna chhod do aur agar matla abr aalud ho to phir Shoban ki ginti tees tak mukammal kar lo .'' muttafaq aleh."
"1971","Hazrat ibne-Umar (Raziallahu anhu) bayan kartey hain, Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ne farmaya : '' be-shak ham ُ ummi ( likhney padhney se naa-balad ( log hain, ham hisab kitab nahin jantey, mahina is tarah aur is tarah aur is tarah hota hai.'' teesri martaba aapney angoothey ko band kar liya , phir farmaya : '' mahina is tarah, is tarah aur is tarah hota hai.'' yani mukammal tees, yani aapney eik martaba untees aur eik martaba tees ka zikr kya. muttafaq aleh."
"1972","Abu Bakra reported God’s messenger as saying: \The months of festival"","" Ramadan and Dhul-hijja"","" are not defective.\""\n - Narrator: Abu Bakra.\n - Hadith: Festival months"","" Ramadan"","" and Dhul-Hijja are not defective even if they have twenty-nine days."""""
"1973","Abu Huraira reported God’s messenger as saying: \None of you must fast one day or two days just before Ramadan"","" except in the case of a man who has been in the habit of observing a particular fast"","" for he may fast on that day.\""\n - Narrator: Abu Huraira.\n - Hadith: Do not fast one or two days before Ramadan unless it is a habitual fast for the individual."""""
"1974","Hazrat Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) bayan kartey hain, Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ne farmaya : ''jab nisf Shoban ho jaey to phir roza na rakho .'' rawahu Abu-Dawood w Tirmizi w ibne-Maja w Darmi ."
"1975","Hazrat Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) bayan kartey hain, Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ne farmaya : '' Ramazan ki khatir Shoban ke chaand (dinon) ki ginti karo.''"
"1976","Hazrat Umme-Salma (Raziallahu anha) bayan karti hain, maine Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ko Shoban ke ilawa do maah lagataar rozey rakhtey huey nahin dekha. rawahu Abu-Dawood w Tirmizi w Nasai w ibne-Maja ."
"1977","Hazrat Ammar bin Yasir (Raziallahu anhu) bayan kartey hain jis shakhs ne shak ke din ka roza rakha to usney abul-Qasim (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ki nafarmani ki ."
"1978","Hazrat ibne-Abbas (Raziallahu anhu) bayan kartey hain, eik Erabi (dehati) (dehati) Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ki khidmat mein hazir hua to usney kaha : maine Ramazan ka chaand dekha hai, aap (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ne farmaya : ''kya tum gawahi detey ho ke Allah ke siwa koi mabud bar-haq nahin?'' usney arz kiya, ji haan , aap (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ne farmaya : ''kya tum gawahi detey ho ke Muhammad (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) Allah ke Rasool hain ?'' usney arz kiya, ji haan , aap (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ne farmaya : '' Bilal ! logon mein aelan kar do ke wo kal roza rakhen.''"
"1979","Hazrat ibne-Umar (Raziallahu anhu) bayan kartey hain log chaand dekhney ke liye jama huey to maine Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ko bataya ke maine usko dekh liya hai, aapney roza rakha aur logon ko bhi roza rakhney ka hukm farmaya.'' rawahu Abu-Dawood aur Nasai."
"1980","Hazrat Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) bayan karti hain, Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) Shoban ki ginti ka deegar mahinon ki nisbat ziyada ehtimam kiya kartey they, phir aap Ramazan ka chaand nazar aaney par roza rakhtay, agar aasman mein baadal hota to aap tees din ki ginti farmatey phir roza rakhtay. rawahu Abu-Dawood."
"1981","Hazrat Abul-Bakhtari (Raziallahu anhu) bayan kartey hain, ham Umre ke liye rawana huye, jab ham ne batan nakhla ke maqam par padaaw dala to ham chaand dekhney ke liye ikhattey huye, to kuchh logon ne kaha : ye teesri raat ka hai, kisi ne kaha : dusri raat ka hai, ham ibne-Abbas (Raziallahu anhu) se miley to ham ne kaha : ham ne chaand dekha to kisi ne kaha : wo teesri raat ka hai aur kisi ne kaha : dusri raat ka hai, unhoney farmaya : tum ne kis raat usey dekha tha? ham ne kaha : falan falan raat , unhoney farmaya : Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ne is (Ramazan) ki muddat uske chaand dekhne par muqarrar ki hai, wo (Ramazan) us raat se shuru hota hai jis raat tum usey dekho. aur Abul-Bakhtari (Raziallahu anhu) ki eik dusri riwayat mein hai : unhoney kaha : ham ne zaat arq ke maqam par Ramazan ka chaand dekha, to ham ne masla daryaft karney ke liye eik aadmi ko ibne-Abbas (Raziallahu anhu) ke paas bheja to unhoney kaha, Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ne farmaya : ''Allah taala ne is (Shoban) ko is (Hilal Ramazan) ka chaand dekhne tak daraz kiya hai, agar aasman par badal ho to ginti ko mukammal kar lo.'' rawahu Muslim."
"1982","Hazrat Anas (Raziallahu anhu) bayan kartey hain, Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ne farmaya : ''sehri khaya karo kyonkey sehri khaney mein barkat hai.'' muttafaq aleh."
"1983","Hazrat Amr bin Aas (Raziallahu anhu) bayan kartey hain, Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ne farmaya : ''hamarey aur ehle-kitab ke rozon mein sehri khaney ka farq hai.'' rawahu Muslim."
"1984","Hazrat Sehal (Raziallahu anhu) bayan kartey hain, Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ne farmaya : ''jab tak log iftaari karney mein jaldi kartey rahengey wo khair aur bhalai par rahengey.'' muttafaq aleh."
"1985","Hazrat umr (Raziallahu anhu) bayan kartey hain, Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ne farmaya : ''jab raat is taraf se aa jaey aur din is taraf palat jaey aur Suraj ghurub ho jaey to roze daar ko chahiye ke wo iftaar karey.'' muttafaq aleh."
"1986","Hazrat Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) bayan kartey hain, Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ne rozon mein wisaal karney se mana farmaya , to kisi aadmi ne aap se arz kiya : Allah ke Rasool ! aap to wisaal farmatey hain? aap (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ne farmaya : ''tum mein se kon meri tarah hai? main raat ko sota hun to mera rab mujhey khila pila deta hai.'' muttafaq aleh."
"1987","Hazrat Hafsa (Raziallahu anha) bayan karti hain, Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ne farmaya : ''jo shakhs tulu Fajr se pehley rozey ki niyat na karey to uska roza nahin.'' Tirmizi, Abu-Dawud, Nasai , Darmi aur Abu-Dawood ne farmaya : Maamer , Zubaidi, ibne-Uena aur Yunus illi ne is hadees ko Hafsa (Raziallahu anha) par moquf qarar diya hai aur in sab ne Zohri se riwayat kiya hai."
"1988","Hazrat Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) bayan kartey hain, Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ne farmaya : ''jab tum mein se koi Azan (Fajr) suney aur (khaney peeney ka ( bartan uskey haath mein ho to wo apni zarurat puri karney ke baad usey nichey rakhey.'' rawahu Abu-Dawood."
"1989","Hazrat Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) bayan kartey , Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ne farmaya : ''Allah taala farmata hai : mujhey apney wo bandey ziyada mehbub hain jo un mein se iftaar karney mein jaldi kartey hain.''"
"1990","Hazrat Salman bin Aamir (Raziallahu anhu) bayan kartey hain, Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ne farmaya : ''jab tum mein se koi iftaar karey to wo khajoor se iftaar karey kyonkey wo baaise-barkat hai, agar wo na paey to phir pani se iftaar kar ley kyonkey wo baaise-tahaarat (paakizgi) hai.'' Ahmed, Tirmizi, Abu-Dawud, Darmi , lekin unhoney ye nahin kaha : ''kyonkey wo baaise-barkat hai.'' sirf Imam Tirmizi ne ye alfaz eik dusri riwayat se naqal kiye hain. rawahu Ahmed, Tirmizi, Abu-Dawood, ibne-Maja aur Darmi."
"1991","Hazrat Anas (Raziallahu anhu) bayan kartey hain, Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) Namaz (maghrib) padhney se pehley chand taza khajuron se iftaar kiya kartey they, agar taza khajuren na hotin to phir chand chhuwaron se aur agar chhuhaarey na hotey to phir pani ke chand ghoont pi liya kartey they. Tirmizi, Abu-Dawood aur Imam Tirmizi ne farmaya : ye hadees Hasan gharib hai. rawahu Tirmizi aur Abu-Dawood."
"1992","Hazrat Zaid bin Khalid (Raziallahu anhu) bayan kartey hain, Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ne farmaya : ''jo shakhs kisi roze-daar ka roza iftaar kiraaey ya kisi Mujahid ki tayyari kara dey to usey bhi us (roze-daar ya Mujahid) ke jaisa ajr milta hai.'' (Behaqi fi-Shobil-Emaan) . aur Mughi Usunna ne Sharahus-Sunnah mein riwayat kiya aur unhoney kaha ye riwayat sahih hai. (rawahu al-Behaqi fi-Shobil-Emaan)."
"1993","Hazrat ibne-Umar (Raziallahu anhu) bayan kartey hain, jab Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) roza iftaar kartey to aap ye dua padha kartey they : ''piyas jati rahi , ragein tar hogaeen aur agar Allah ne chaha to ajr Sabit ho gaya.'' rawahu Abu-Dawood."
"1994","Hazrat Muaz bin Zohra (Raziallahu anhu) bayan kartey hain ke Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) jab iftaar kartey to aap (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ye dua padha kartey they : ''aey Allah ! maine terey hi liye roza rakha aur terey hi rizq se iftaar kiya.'' Abu-Dawood ne isey mursal riwayat kiya hai."
"1995","Hazrat Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) bayan kartey hain, Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ne farmaya : ''jab tak log iftaar karney mein jaldi kartey rahengey Deen ghalib rahega kyonkey yahood aur Nasara (iftaar karney mein) takheer (deri) kartey hain.'' rawahu Abu-Dawood aur ibne-Maja."
"1996","Hazrat Abu Atiyaa (Raziallahu anhu) bayan kartey hain, main aur Masruq , Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) ki khidmat mein hazir huey to ham ne arz kiya : Ummul-momenin ! Muhammad (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ke Sahaba mein se do aadmi hain un mein se eik jaldi iftaar kartey hain aur jald hi Namaz (maghrib) padhtey hain, jabkey doosrey der se iftaar kartey hain aur der se Namaz padhtey hain, unhoney farmaya : un mein se kon jald iftaar karta hai aur jald Namaz padhta hai? ham ne arz kiya Abdullah bin Masood (Raziallahu anhu) , unhoney farmaya : Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ne bhi aisey hi kiya, jabkey doosrey Abu-Musa (Raziallahu anhu) hain. rawahu Muslim."
"1997","Hazrat Irbaz bin Saariya (Raziallahu anhu) bayan kartey hain, Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ne Ramazan mein mujhey sehri ki dawat detey huey farmaya : ''mubarak khaney ki taraf aao.'' rawahu Abu-Dawood aur Nasai."
"1998","Hazrat Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) bayan kartey hain, Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ne farmaya : ''momin ki behtareen sehri khajoor hai.'' rawahu Abu-Dawood."
"1999","Hazrat Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) bayan kartey , Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ne farmaya : ''jo shakhs (roze ki haalat mein) jhoot aur burey aamaal tarak nahin karta to Allah ko koi hajat (zaroorat) nahin ke wo shakhs apna khana peena tarak kar dey.'' Bukhari ."
"2000","Hazrat Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) bayan karti hain, Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) roze ki haalat mein bosa ley liya kartey they aur galey mil liya kartey they aur aap apni khahish par tum se ziyada qabu rakhney waley they. muttafaq aleh."
"2001","Hazrat Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) bayan karti hain, Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ko Ramazan mein kabhi jima (sambhog) ki wajeh se haalate-janabat mein subah ho jati to aap ghusl kartey aur phir roza rakhtay. muttafaq aleh."
"2002","Hazrat ibne-Abbas (Raziallahu anhu) bayan kartey hain ke Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ne ehram aur roze ki haalat mein pachhney lagwaaey. muttafaq aleh."
"2003","Hazrat Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) bayan kartey hain, Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ne farmaya : ''jo shakhs bhool jaey ke wo roze se hai aur wo kha ley ya pi ley to wo apna roza pura karey kyonkey usey to Allah ne khilaya pilaya hai.'' muttafaq aleh."
"2004","Hazrat Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) bayan kartey hain, ham Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ki khidmat mein hazir they ke itney main eik aadmi ne aap ki khidmat mein hazir ho kar arz kiya : Allah ke Rasool ! main to maara gaya, aap (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ne farmaya : ''tumhen kya hua?'' usney arz kiya : main rozey ki haalat main apni ehliya se jima (sambhog) kar betha hun, Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ne farmaya : ''kya tumharey paas koi ghulam hai jisey to azad kar dey?'' usney arz kiya, nahin, aap (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ne farmaya : ''kya tum lagataar do maah rozey rakh saktey ho?'' usney arz kiya, nahin, aap (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ne farmaya : ''kya tum saath miskinon ko khana khila saktey ho?'' usney arz kiya, nahin, aap (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ne farmaya : ''beth jaao.'' isliye Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ne twaqquf farmaya (thehra liya), ham isi beech mein they ke khajuron ka eik bada tokraa Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ki khidmat mein pesh kiya gaya, aap (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ne farmaya : ''masla daryaft karney wala kahan hai? '' us shakhs ne arz kiya, main hazir hun, aap (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ne farmaya : ''ye lo isey sadqa kar do.'' us aadmi ne arz kiya, Allah ke Rasool ! kya main apney se ziyada mohtaj shakhs par sadqa karun? Allah ki qism ! (Madina mein) do pathreeley kinaron ke darmiyan koi aisa ghar nahin jo merey ghar walon se ziyada zarurat mand ho, (ye sun kar) Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) is qadr hansay ke aap ke daant Mubarak zahir ho gaey, phir aap (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ne farmaya : ''isey apney ghar walon ko khilao.'' muttafaq aleh."
"2005","Hazrat Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) roze ki haalat mein kabhi unka bosa ley liya kartey they aur unki zaban choos liya kartey they."
"2006","Hazrat Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai kisi aadmi ne , roze daar ke liye apni ehliya se galey milney ke barey mein Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) se masla puchha to aapney usey rukhsat (chhoot) inayat farma di, phir eik aur aadmi aaya aur usney aap se masla puchha to aapney usey rok diya, jis shakhs ko rukhsat inayat farmaai thi wo boodha aadmi tha aur jisey rok diya tha wo eik no-jawan shakhs tha. rawahu Abu-Dawood."
"2007","Hazrat Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) bayan kartey hain, Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ne farmaya : ''jis shakhs ko roze ki haalat mein qai aa jaey to is par koi qaza nahin aur jo shakhs amadan qai karey to wo (roze ki) qaza karey.'' Tirmizi, Abu-Dawud, ibne-Maja , Darmi aur Imam Tirmizi ne farmaya : ye hadees gharib hai, ham Esa bin Yunus se marwi (bayan) hadees ke hawaley se hi isey jantey hain, jabkey Muhammad yani Imam Bukhari ne farmaya : main isey mehfooz nahin samajhta."
"2008","Hazrat Maadaan bin Talha se riwayat hai ke Abu-Darda (Raziallahu anhu) ne usey hadees bayan ki ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ne qai ki to aapney roza iftaar kar liya, raawi bayan kartey hain, main dimashq ki masjid mein Soban se mila to maine kaha ke Abu-Darda (Raziallahu anhu) ne mujhey hadees bayan ki hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ne qai ki to aapney roza iftaar kar liya , unhoney kaha : unhon (yani abu-Darda (Raziallahu anhu)) ne theek kaha hai, aur maine aap ke liye aap ke wuzu ka pani undela tha. rawahu Abu-Dawood, Tirmizi aur Darmi."
"2009","Hazrat Aamir bin Rabeea (Raziallahu anhu) bayan kartey hain, maine un-ginat martaba Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ko roza ki haalat mein miswak kartey huey dekha hai."
"2010","Hazrat Anas (Raziallahu anhu) bayan kartey hain, eik aadmi Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ki khidmat mein hazir hua to usney arz kiya : mujhey aashoob chashm (aankh dukhna ya aankh ki takleef) hai kya main roze ki haalat mein surma dal lun? aap (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ne farmaya : ''haan.'' Tirmizi aur unhoney farmaya : iski sanad qawi nahin, Abu Aatiqa raawi zaeef hai."
"2011","Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ke kisi sahabi se riwayat hai, unhoney kaha : maine maqame-araj par Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ko haalate-roze mein piyas ya garmi ki wajeh se sar par pani daltey huey dekha. rawahu Malik aur Abu-Dawood."
"2012","Hazrat Shaddad bin Aus (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) Baqee main eik aadmi ke paas se guzrey jabke wo pachhney lagwa raha tha, aap mera haath thaamey huey they aur Ramazan ki atthaara taareekh thi. aap (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ne farmaya : ''pachhney laganey aur lagwaaney waley ka roza toot gay .'' Abu-Dawud, ibne-Maja, Darmi. al-Sheikh Imam Muhiussunnah ne farmaya : aur jin baaz hazraat ne roze ki haalat mein pachhney lagwaaney ki ijazat di hai, unhoney ye taaweel ki hai ke pachhney lagwaaney wala kamzori ki wajeh se iftaar ke qarib pahunch jata hai, jabke pachhney laganey wala us choosney ki wajeh se pet mein koi chiz pahunchney se bach nahin sakta. rawahu Abu-Dawood aur ibne-Maja aur Darmi."
"2013","Hazrat Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) bayan kartey hain, Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ne farmaya : ''jo shakhs kisi rukhsat (safar waghera) aur marz ke baghair Ramazan ka eik roza chhod dey to phir agar wo puri zindagi rozey rakhta rahey to wo us eik din ke rozey ke ajr w sawab ko nahin pa sakta.'' Ahmed, Tirmizi, Abu-Dawud, ibne-Maja , Darmi aur Imam Bukhari ne (ترجمۃ الباب) mein riwayat kiya hai aur Imam Tirmizi ne farmaya : maine Muhammad yani Imam Bukhari (Raziallahu anhu) ko farmatey huey suna : main Abul Mutwwis ko is hadees ke ilawa nahin janta ke usney koi aur hadees bhi riwayat ki ho."
"2014","anhwn nay khda kay rswl ka byan krtay hwyay kha: \bht say rwzh darwn kw apnay rwzay say swayay pyas kay kchh nhyn mlta، awr bht say jw rat kw nmaz prhtay hyn an kw shb bydary kay swa kchh nhyn mlta۔\"" darymy nay asay mntql kya۔ lqyt ky rwayt b۔ sabrh ka wzw krnay ka tryqh bab myn btaya gya hay۔ [mshq kay dwsray hsay myn]"""""
